{% comment %}
  Custom robots.txt.liquid for wcsafety.com — implements P0 fix from
  the 2026-05-15 SEO audit (section 4.1).

  Where this goes in Shopify:
    Online Store → Themes → ... → Edit code → Templates → Add a new
    template → "robots" → "liquid" → paste this file's contents.

  What it does relative to Shopify's default:
    - Keeps every default Shopify Disallow (cart, checkout, admin,
      orders, account, policies search, etc.).
    - Adds:
        Disallow: /collections/*?*
      so Googlebot stops crawling the faceted/sort/pagination URLs
      like /collections/all/products/<slug>?_pos=&_fid=&_ss= that
      are currently being indexed as duplicates of /products/<slug>.
    - Adds a Disallow for /collections/all/products/ entirely as a
      belt-and-braces measure (the canonical URL is /products/<slug>
      with no collection prefix).
    - Keeps the Sitemap directive emitted by Shopify.
{% endcomment %}
{%- for group in robots.default_groups -%}
  {{- group.user_agent }}

  {%- for rule in group.rules -%}
    {{ rule }}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Custom additions for wcsafety.com {%- endcomment -%}
  {{ "Disallow: /collections/*?*" }}
  {{ "Disallow: /collections/*/products/" }}
  {{ "Disallow: /collections/all/products/" }}

  {%- if group.sitemap != blank %}

  {{ group.sitemap }}
  {%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
